She said, I'll take them, but then thought, his phone is filled with my photos

54
00:02:30,200 --> 00:02:32,240
What about the gifts you gave him? will you take them?

55
00:02:32,240 --> 00:02:34,320
What about the gifts he gave you? will you take them?

56
